WEBVTT

00:33:29.713 --> 00:33:31.727
And work harder, longer and smarter.

00:33:32.741 --> 00:33:35.412
But they can also lead us to cut corners,

00:33:35.436 --> 00:33:38.387
especially if we're about to fall
just short of the goal.

00:33:38.813 --> 00:33:41.874
Sometimes our creative strategies
for hitting bold targets

00:33:41.898 --> 00:33:44.101
stretch beyond the bounds
of what's ethical.

00:33:48.211 --> 00:33:49.635
DF: So I think

00:33:49.659 --> 00:33:54.262
he was increasingly emboldened
by what we could do as a company,

00:33:54.286 --> 00:33:57.840
and when we really focused
on trying to tackle something,

00:33:57.864 --> 00:34:01.948
and so, yeah, I think he wanted to win,